WEBVTT

00:02:58.674 --> 00:03:03.512
which is we want to invest
in powerful, positive change

00:03:03.512 --> 00:03:04.931
that will endure.

00:03:04.931 --> 00:03:11.562
So our view is, the paradigm,
sometimes, that's presented,

00:03:11.604 --> 00:03:17.235
which is you have to choose
between profits,

00:03:17.235 --> 00:03:19.445
investment returns

00:03:19.487 --> 00:03:20.863
and social good.

00:03:21.239 --> 00:03:23.199
And we believe that’s a false choice.

00:03:23.908 --> 00:03:28.287
That, in fact, technology
should be a great enabler.

00:03:28.329 --> 00:03:32.250
But the reality is "What's the intention?"